[228.432638, "o", "ave hexpr : challengeAuthorize b a f =\r\n    53\t      if n ≤ u64Max - a then\r\n    54\t        (if a + n ≤ b then some (a + n) else none)\r\n    55\t      else none := by\r\n    56\t    unfold challengeAuthorize quoteSettlementTicket assembleTicket\r\n    57\t    dsimp only\r\n    58\t    by_cases h : n ≤ u64Max - a\r\n    59\t    · simp [n, h, commitTicket] at *\r\n    60\t    · simp [n, h, commitTicket] at *\r\n    61\t  rw [hexpr]\r\n    62\t  by_cases h : n ≤ u64Max - a\r\n    63\t  · rw [if_pos h]\r\n    64\t    by_cases hbal : a + n ≤ b\r\n    65\t    · rw [if_pos hbal]\r\n    66\t      simp only [Option.some.injEq, ← UInt64.toNat_inj]\r\n    67\t      simp [UInt64.le_iff_toNat_le, UInt64.toNat_add, hm] at h hbal ⊢\r\n    68\t      unfold policyDebit\r\n    69\t      omega\r\n    70\t    · rw [if_neg hbal]\r\n    71\t      simp only [reduceCtorEq, false_iff]\r\n    72\t      simp [UInt64.le_iff_toNat_le, UInt64.toNat_add, hm] at h hbal\r\n    73\t      unfold policyDebit\r\n    74\t      omega\r\n    75\t  · rw [if_neg h]\r\n    76\t    simp only [red"]
